{"book":"lines-angles","bookTitle":"Lines and angles","concept":5,"title":"Angles on a line and around a point","grades":"Grade 7","goal":"I can find unknown angles on a straight line and around a point.","teach":"Angles on a <b>straight line</b> add up to 180°. Angles <b>around a point</b> add up to 360°. Two angles that add to 90° are <b>complementary</b>; two that add to 180° are <b>supplementary</b>.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:260px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 200.0 111.54998149518622\"><g transform=\"translate(-50.0,-30.5)\"><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"228.0\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"189.0\" y2=\"52.5\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"72.0\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M172.0,120.0 A22,22 0 0 0 161.0,100.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"183.4\" y=\"105.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">60°</text><path d=\"M161.0,100.9 A22,22 0 0 0 128.0,120.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"128.5\" y=\"87.3\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">120°</text><circle cx=\"150.0\" cy=\"120.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#444444\"/></g></svg></span><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:236px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 181.75146656328027 170.95243829050227\"><g transform=\"translate(-68.2,-21.2)\"><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"228.0\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"136.5\" y2=\"43.2\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"90.2\" y2=\"170.1\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M172.0,120.0 A22,2